    {
      "id": "adv-shutdown-subsystem",
      "prompt": "Model the shutdown subsystem across the system and logical analyses. In SA, create the functions 'Detect Shutdown Request', 'Open Shutdown Circuit', 'Discharge DC Link' and 'Report Shutdown State', connected in that order by the functional exchanges 'Shutdown Request', 'Circuit Open' and 'Discharge Complete'. In LA, create the components 'Shutdown Controller' and 'Discharge Circuit', create a logical function realizing each system function with the same name, allocate the logical 'Detect Shutdown Request', 'Open Shutdown Circuit' and 'Report Shutdown State' to Shutdown Controller, and allocate the logical 'Discharge DC Link' to Discharge Circuit.",
      "checks": [
        {
