    {
      "id": "adv-bms-logical-view-diagram",
      "prompt": "In the logical architecture, create the components 'Battery Controller', 'Cell Monitor' and 'Contactor Driver'. Allocate new logical functions to them: 'Supervise Pack' to Battery Controller, 'Measure Cells' to Cell Monitor and 'Drive Contactors' to Contactor Driver. Connect the functions with functional exchanges 'Cell Data' (Measure Cells to Supervise Pack) and 'Contactor Command' (Supervise Pack to Drive Contactors), connect the components with component exchanges 'Cell Bus' and 'Contactor Line' that carry those functional exchanges. Then create a Logical Architecture Blank diagram named 'BMS Logical View' showing the three components, their functions and the exchanges, and lay it out cleanly.",
      "checks": [
